We can join him now.

1060
00:57:33,520 --> 00:57:36,120
我很想说对于没能
I'd like to say that I'm sorry

1061
00:57:36,160 --> 00:57:39,360
亲自去领这个奖
我感到很遗憾，
about not being able
to accept this award
personally,

1062
00:57:39,400 --> 00:57:43,600
但我那纯属撒谎。
我其实正在巴巴多斯的海滩上晒太阳呢。
but I'd be lying.
I'm actually on a beach
in Barbados.

1063
00:57:43,640 --> 00:57:46,960
至于这个奖本身嘛，
既然已经颁给我了，
As for the award itself,
having been given it,

1064
00:57:47,000 --> 00:57:49,560
那我真是太庆幸没亲自去领了，
I'm delighted not to be able
to accept it personally,

1065
00:57:49,600 --> 00:57:51,680
因为毫无疑问，
because this is,
without question,

1066
00:57:51,720 --> 00:57:54,680
这是我这辈子见过最寒酸的奖了。
the most pathetic award
I've ever seen in my life.

1067
00:57:55,720 --> 00:57:57,760
不过，它对我意味着什么呢？
What does it mean
to me, though?

1068
00:57:57,800 --> 00:58:02,440
我赢了一个妹子，赢了JK。
这意义重大。
I beat a girl. I beat JK.
That means a lot.

1069
00:58:02,480 --> 00:58:04,480
而且我还赢了
杰里米·克拉克森。
And I also beat
Jeremy Clarkson.

1070
00:58:04,520 --> 00:58:06,840
这对我来说意义可太非凡了。
And that means
an awful lot to me.

1071
00:58:06,880 --> 00:58:09,000
呃……
Um...

1072
00:58:09,040 --> 00:58:12,000
顺便提一句，杰里米，
我听了那期《荒岛唱片》……
As a passing thought, Jeremy,
I have heard
Desert Island Discs...

1073
00:58:12,040 --> 00:58:17,320
你居然还有脸
嘲笑我的音乐品味？
And you have the audacity
to criticise my taste
in music?

1074
00:58:17,360 --> 00:58:19,440
希望明年还能见到你们。
Hopefully I'll be seeing you
again next year.

1075
00:58:19,480 --> 00:58:21,880
明年我还想再来跑一次。
真挺好玩的。
I'd like to do it again
next year.
It's been a lot of fun.

1076
00:58:21,920 --> 00:58:24,560
圣诞快乐，
新年快乐。再见。
Happy Christmas.
Happy New Year. Goodbye.

1077
00:58:26,480 --> 00:58:27,600
好……
Now...

1078
00:58:29,160 --> 00:58:30,800
要是他刚才嘴甜点，
If he'd been nice,

1079
00:58:30,840 --> 00:58:33,160
我们这期节目到这儿就收工了。
we'd have wrapped the show up
here and now.

1080
00:58:33,200 --> 00:58:34,520
但他偏不。
But he wasn't.

1081
00:58:34,560 --> 00:58:37,920
那么，谁想看看
会发生什么——
So, who'd like to see
what happened

1082
00:58:37,960 --> 00:58:41,400
当我们把他塞进
那台Noble的驾驶座之后？
when we put him
in the driver's seat
of the Noble?

1083
00:58:41,440 --> 00:58:44,360
-想看！
-赶紧放片子！
-Oh, yes.
-Play the tape.

1084
00:58:44,400 --> 00:58:46,600
杰里米：好嘞。
这里是直通弯。
JEREMY: Right.
This is the Follow-through.

1085
00:58:46,640 --> 00:58:48,960
开车的正如大家所见，
是考威尔。
Cowell driving,
as you can see.

1086
00:58:49,000 --> 00:58:51,360
正在逼近全赛道
最快的一个弯角，
Coming to the fastest corner
on the track,

1087
00:58:51,400 --> 00:58:54,440
时速115英里，然后……
115 miles an hour, and...

1088
00:58:54,480 --> 00:58:56,680
[轮胎尖叫声]
哎哟我的妈呀！
[TYRES SCREECH]
Oh, dearie me!

1089
00:58:58,080 --> 00:58:59,600
这简直完……
That is compl...

1090
00:59:00,640 --> 00:59:02,120
彻头彻尾，
Absolutely,

1091
00:59:02,160 --> 00:59:04,320
-就是个一无是处的无能家伙。
-烂透了。
-totally incompetent man.
-Rubbish.

1092
00:59:04,360 --> 00:59:07,080
-我觉得我们大功告成了。
-我也觉得。
-And I think we've made it.
-I think so.

1093
00:59:07,120 --> 00:59:10,120
-咱们只花了47便士就做完了一期节目。
-可不是嘛。
-We've made a show for 47p.
-Yep.

1094
00:59:10,160 --> 00:59:13,760
大功告成。詹姆斯，
麻烦奏乐送客吧。
We've finished it. So, James,
play us out, please.

1095
00:59:13,800 --> 00:59:16,800
-[弹奏《Top Gear》主题曲]
-这就对味了。
-[PLAYS TOP GEARTHEME]
-There we go.

1096
00:59:16,840 --> 00:59:19,920
明年，我们还会
公路实测大量新车，
Next year, we'll be
road-testing lots of new cars,

1097
00:59:19,960 --> 00:59:23,680
当然前提是，
台里能给咱们批一大笔预算。
providing, of course,
we get a big bag of money.

1098
00:59:23,720 --> 00:59:25,840
在此期间，
好好享受剩下的假期，
In the meantime,
enjoy the rest
of your holidays

1099
00:59:25,880 --> 00:59:29,080
祝大家度过一个
非常、非常快乐的新年。
晚安！
and have a very,
very happy New Year.
Good night.

